  "_comment": "Seller Opportunity model. Every signal maps to ONE of five dimensions; each dimension is its own 0-100 component score, and the combined Seller Opportunity Score is the capped sum of all contributions. A lead firing across MULTIPLE dimensions (dimensions_firing) is more robust than one dimension maxed. Most signal_types below are config-ready: they score automatically once a source emits them (see signals_catalog.md for each one's data availability). Weights track seller motivation; tune freely.",

